Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: rockchip-rga: Add RK3528 compatible

The RK3528 has the RGA2E of the RK3568, on the RK3288's programming
interface.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
